      I'm a Computer Engineering Student at Hacettepe University.
    </p>
    <hr class="border-flexoki-base-4 dark:border-flexoki-base-c" />
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
      <li>
        GitHub{' '}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/alperen-albayrak"
          class="text-flexoki-base-8 dark:text-flexoki-base-7 hover:text-flexoki-black dark:hover:text-flexoki-base-5 underline underline-offset-2"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          @alperen-albayrak
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Instagram{' '}
        <a
          href="https://instagram.com/alperenalbayrak__"
